+// r3 (xseg-fix-r3): the cheaper fix. Queue 183 measured A + C at C8 -1.26 % (C only -0.99 %, A on top of
+// C -1.45 %); C's only addition to the copy path is 1 + floor((bytes - 2) / 2 MiB) hipHostGetDevicePointer calls per
