+/// Probe, fused route (rows >= 96): production HcDownF16Gemm already wrote `prod` (F16); B runs into a probe buffer
+/// (rows < 1,024) and is compared bitwise; every kSweepEvery-th call with >= kSweepMinRows rows also sweeps.
+inline bool ProbeFused(const void* w, const void* x, const void* prod, std::uint32_t n, hipStream_t stream) {
