+// fz_body_*.inc byte for byte: the production kernel text with three asserted header edits) under fz-214's task map
+// (w3fz_plan.h = fz-214's fz_plan.h byte for byte, Dell MAP PASS digest 7929fcfd9a27fdd7), in production launch order
+// (214 "merged" order). Difference to the probe's fz_merged.hip.cpp: the bodies receive the RUNTIME values production
+// passes (pointers, k / rows, theta, eps, mask words, block counts, capacities) instead of the probe's compile-time
